---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import { classes } from '../../styles';
---
<DocsLayout title="Theme" description="Set supported tokens and animations with CSSX @theme input."><header><p class={classes.eyebrow}>Core concept</p><h1 class={classes.title}>Theme</h1><p class={classes.lead}>Set supported tokens and animations with CSSX @theme input.</p></header><section class={classes.section}><h2 class={classes.heading}>Define tokens</h2><pre class={classes.code}><code>@theme {`{`}
  --spacing: 0.3125rem;
  --color-brand: oklch(58% 0.2 255);
  --breakpoint-tablet: 52rem;
  --animation-duration-fast: 150ms;
{`}`}</code></pre></section><section class={classes.section}><h2 class={classes.heading}>Output modes</h2><p class={classes.copy}>@theme and @theme inline put used token values in utility rules. @theme reference writes used variables. @theme static writes all variables. @theme prefix(name) uses prefixed variable names. Theme blocks merge in source order. Do not mix modes or prefixes. Animation longhands resolve --animation-duration-name and --animation-ease-name tokens, so animation-duration-fast uses --animation-duration-fast.</p></section></DocsLayout>
